/-- a number in `[2, B]` coprime to `k!` is prime when `B < (k + 1) ^ 2` -/
theorem prime_of_coprime_fact (k B q : ℕ) (hB : B < (k + 1) * (k + 1)) (h2 : 2 ≤ q) (hq : q ≤ B)
